  <frame id="418:28202" name="Ask alo / Interaction contract" x="3000" y="2280" width="1440" height="1040">
    <text id="418:28203" name="Ask alo · Interaction contract" x="40" y="40" width="1360" height="36" />
    <text id="418:28204" name="Each new request opens a task window. Follow-ups stay in that window. This is chat plus readable activity, not a terminal log. Example content is illustrative; never simulate completed actions in production." x="40" y="100" width="1360" height="50" />
    <text id="418:28205" name="One shared 48px circular composer action: Send arrow when idle; solid Stop square while alo is working. Never display separate Send and Stop controls. Stop requests cancellation: show Stopping until acknowledged, then return to Send. Preserve the draft; typing does not automatically submit or interrupt. Disable empty-draft Send and repeated cancellation. Accessible names and tooltips follow the current action. Announce status changes. All controls remain inside the composer. Model and permission popovers open upward; model changes apply to the next request, without silent provider switching. Keep model name and processing destination visible." x="40" y="174" width="1360" height="100" />
    <text id="418:28206" name="Permissions belong to this task. Show exact shared resources and granted scopes. New access is explicit; revoke blocks future access without claiming to undo completed work or recall transmitted data." x="40" y="298" width="1360" height="50" />
    <text id="418:28207" name="Approval cards name the action, destination and effect. Allow once and Deny are equally reachable. Denying must not be interpreted as permission to try another route." x="40" y="372" width="1360" height="25" />
    <text id="418:28208" name="Stop requests cancellation immediately. Show Stopping until the runtime confirms. Then report what finished, what changed and what did not. Continue is deliberate and requires revalidation of permissions." x="40" y="421" width="1360" height="50" />
    <text id="418:28209" name="Conversation accepts user replies while work runs; explain whether a reply is queued or redirects at the next safe step. Never imply an in-flight action was changed immediately. Enter sends; Shift+Enter adds a line." x="40" y="495" width="1360" height="50" />
    <text id="418:28210" name="Activity details contain actions, outcomes and errors—not hidden reasoning, credentials or private model traces. Open result files through real application paths." x="40" y="569" width="1360" height="25" />
    <text id="418:28211" name="Minimising preserves the task and shows activity plus Stop in the minimised-window panel. Closing a running task requires an explicit Stop-and-close or Keep-running choice; do not silently kill or orphan it." x="40" y="618" width="1360" height="50" />
    <text id="418:28212" name="Use Manrope and semantic tokens. Teal identifies alo activity; human controls and focus use navy. Support keyboard, screen readers, translation and increased text size. Show resource removal as a named action." x="40" y="692" width="1360" height="50" />
    <text id="418:28213" name="Prototype: Working model and permissions controls open their panels; click the same control to return. Stop demonstrates Stopping only; runtime confirmation is not simulated by a timer." x="40" y="766" width="1360" height="22" />
  </frame>
